### The most chosen

- `learned-hilde28-valley-sickness`, by hilde28 on becoming adult, chosen 94 times, a candidate 1573 times:
  > Word has come that sickness is spreading in the villages two valleys over. The danger is closer than before. Mention this to whoever is near you so they can prepare, and go on with your day. [!warn(target=nearby, topic=sickness moving closer from two valleys over)]
- `learned-ilsa-storyteller-inn`, by ilsa on becoming apprentice, chosen 46 times, a candidate 163 times:
  > A traveling storyteller has arrived up the east road and is staying at the inn. If you find yourself near the inn, go and listen to what they have to say. [!go(to=inn)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=the traveling storyteller at the inn)]
- `learned-edda-3`, by edda on becoming elder, chosen 44 times, a candidate 594 times:
  > When the village gathers at the well in the evening, join them. It is a time for community and sharing news, such as the arrival of a traveling storyteller or the status of the water. Listen and participate in the communal gathering. [!go(to=well)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=what is being discussed at the well)]
- `learned-ilsa-east-road-storyteller`, by ilsa on becoming adult, chosen 33 times, a candidate 456 times:
  > A traveling storyteller is staying at the inn on the east road. While his presence is noted, the road remains a vector for sickness and rot. Avoid the east road and the inn to prevent exposure to whatever he may have carried. [!avoid(place=east_road, ticks=8)]
- `learned-jory-03`, by jory on becoming apprentice, chosen 32 times, a candidate 205 times:
  > It is night and the village is in trouble. If you are out, return to your home or the watchpost to rest. Do not wander the dark roads while raiders are near. Sleep until morning to be ready for the day's work. [!rest(until=morning, ticks=20)]
- `learned-ilsa-wolf-warning`, by ilsa on becoming apprentice, chosen 27 times, a candidate 1429 times:
  > Word has come of wolves seen at the edge of the high pastures. This is a danger that could come this way. Mention it to whoever is near you so they can be wary, and go on with your day. [!warn(target=nearby, topic=wolves seen at the edge of the high pastures)]
- `learned-sten-inn-storyteller`, by sten on becoming elder, chosen 24 times, a candidate 239 times:
  > A traveling storyteller has arrived at the inn via the east road. Go to the inn to hear their tales and gather news from the outside world. Listen for updates on the roads and the wider region. [!go(to=inn)] [!talk(target=nearby, topic=traveler news)]
- `learned-nils-night-schoolyard`, by nils on becoming apprentice, chosen 23 times, a candidate 249 times:
  > It is night and dark, and the schoolyard is empty. Go home and rest until morning when the village wakes. [!go(to=home)] [!rest(until=morning)]

